  <h2>Open questions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>How close can a model that runs inside the hospital get to a cloud model on grounding?</li>
    <li>Can a doctor check an answer against the record in seconds, as rule 3 demands? That takes testing with clinicians, not just benchmarks.</li>
